+"""A minimal reactive programming system.
+
+Cells form a directed acyclic graph: an ``InputCell`` holds a settable value and
+``ComputeCell`` instances derive their value from a list of other cells. When an
+input changes, all cells that (transitively) depend on it are recomputed in
+dependency order, then callbacks are fired once for each cell whose value in the
+new stable state differs from its value in the previous stable state.
+"""
+
